<% content_for :title, "#{@target.name} — NavishAI" %>
<main class="page-shell">
  <%= link_to "Evaluation targets", workspace_corpus_evaluation_targets_path(Current.workspace, @corpus), class: "back-link" %>
  <div class="page-heading"><div><h1><%= @target.name %></h1><p><%= {"http_conversation" => "Bounded HTTP conversation", "http" => "HTTP endpoint", "scripted" => "Scripted fixture, not a live agent", "recorded" => "Recorded output, not a new agent execution"}.fetch(@version.adapter) %> · version <%= @version.number %> · <%= @version.processing_version %>.</p></div></div>
  <nav class="workspace-tabs" aria-label="Target versions"><% @versions.each do |version| %><%= link_to "Version #{version.number}", workspace_corpus_evaluation_target_path(Current.workspace, @corpus, @target, version: version.number), aria: { current: version.id == @version.id ? "page" : nil } %><% end %></nav>
  <% if %w[http http_conversation].include?(@version.adapter) %><p role="status">This target sends visible case context and permitted knowledge outside NavishAI only after you confirm disclosure and start a run. Conversation targets also forward the actual transcript and conditionally released planned user messages, at most eleven calls per case. Credentials stay with the operator. No redirect or automatic retry occurs; a timeout may leave the remote outcome unknown. Local deletion cannot recall sent data.</p><% end %>
  <section class="section-block"><h2>Fixed configuration</h2>
    <% if @version.adapter == "recorded" %><p><%= link_to "Trace record #{@version.trace_item_id}", source_evidence_path(@version.trace_item) %> · reported agent version <%= SupportTrace.payload(@version.trace_item)["target_version"] %>.</p><p>Replay stays local and requires identical situation, known facts and permitted knowledge, including references. It cannot stand in for an answer to revised context. Configured judges still require separate disclosure consent.</p><% else %><pre class="evidence-text"><%= JSON.pretty_generate(@version.configuration) %></pre><% end %>
    <p><%= link_to "Choose a suite to run", workspace_corpus_eval_suites_path(Current.workspace, @corpus) %>. A run freezes the selected target version and case inputs.</p></section>
  <% if Current.require_membership!.can_manage_work? && @version.id == @target.current_version_id %><section class="section-block config-panel"><h2>Revise target</h2><p>A change creates a new version, leaving previous runs untouched.</p><%= render "form", url: workspace_corpus_evaluation_target_path(Current.workspace, @corpus, @target), method: :patch %></section><% end %>
</main>
